window.products.push({"id":489148,"name":"GRUHUM Natural Fibre Multicolour Handwoven 5'x8' ft Boho Charm Farmhouse Jute Area Rug Soft Braided Rug for Living Room Bedroom Hallways Enterways Rec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bEfc486YL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"RECTANGLE JUTE AREA RUG - These 5x8 ft natural multi rectangle area rugs are handcrafted by artisan rug makers from sustainable 100% natural Premium Jute and Multicolour Cotton Chindi that is elegant and feels soft on bare feet. This rug is great for the high traffic areas of your home and will add a layer of comfort underfoot. With its rectangle design, this rug is a perfect way to add balance to a room or incorporate a softer element into an interior design. ATTRACTIVE & DURABLE - The GRUHUM Jute Rug is a great choice for living rooms, bedrooms, and any part of your home where you want to introduce a natural, organic feeling. The warm, neutral tones work well with nearly any decorating style and provide a pleasing backdrop to enhance the beauty of your furniture. With lasting texture underfoot, the rectangular design of the rug adds a gorgeous feature to a room and works beautifully under a bed, dining table or in the center of an empty spaces. HANDMADE RUGS- We love the natural Jute and colourful Cotton that is handwoven in a stunning braided style. We love the raw shades and coloring of the jute fibers for a textured and neutral floor covering that is sure to inspire your home. Position under a dining table and you’ll have a relaxed and stylish dining space or lay in a living room under a coffee table and sofa, and you’ll have a cosy intimate space to relax in. SUPERIOR QUALITY- Along with it's rich texture and exceptional durability, the excellent craftsmanship and exquisite hand braided jute Cotton area rug details are some of the most impressive features of our products, making them easily stand out and catch people's eye. Handmade, high quality, and low pile, it is the perfect low maintenance rug for any room of your home. Made from jute, which is generally considered an eco-friendly material and anti-static. NATURAL FIBER - Natural adds both color and texture to a room. With lasting texture underfoot, the rectangular design of the rug adds symmetry to a room. The warm natural tones look stunning in a range of styles including Hamptons, coastal, vintage, or moderns. A slight color variation is expected due to the NATURAL FIBER we use to create our area rugs. Casual style is versatile enough to integrate with any contemporary, modern, bohemian, and transitional styles of home Décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bEfc486YL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRUHUM","source_asin":"B0BFHFC9L8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFHFC9L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFHFC9L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
