window.products.push({"id":489158,"name":"KUBEI USB Rechargeable Food Scale Digital Kitchen Scale 10Kg x 1g High Accuracy Weight Grams and oz for Cooking Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JYZsJkNCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"High precision: Our kitchen scale has a maximum weighing capacity of 10kg, the precision is 1g, and the error range is within ±3g. The high-precision sensor can quickly sense the weight of the object and accurately weigh it. 9 weighing units g/ ct/ dwt/ ozt/ oz/ gn/ lb/ kg/ ml Easy tare: Equipped with tare function and auto-zero function. Put the container on the scale, press the \"TARE\" button, then put the items into the container, you can get an accurate value of the items Multiple uses: Multiple usage scenarios. Our kitchen scale can be used for cooking, baking, making drinks, weighing coffee beans and so on. The stainless steel scale surface is waterproof and easy to clean, so don't worry about leaving stains on the scale surface after making delicious food Multiple features: In order to better protect the user experience, the four corners of our kitchen scal has been finely polished without hurting hands; the scale platform is made of stainless steel, which is waterproof and dustproof, easy to clean, and there is a protective film on the scale platform Power supply: Three power supply modes. 2 AAA batteries（included),charging or plug-in through USB charging cable (included). And our kitchen scales could set the shut off time, also can turn off the automatic shutdown function, using manual shutdown","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JYZsJkNCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUBEI","source_asin":"B07YK9FNQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YK9FNQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YK9FNQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":489159,"name":"Surgeon Coffee Mug. Surgeon gift 11 oz. black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vQoTHdBYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"? Creativity: Buy awesome Surgeon coffee mug for the one you know, the one you work with or the one with you are related to! The unique and funny coffee or tea cup is a great way to express your love and gratitude towards your special one. That special one may be your friend, parent, better half, colleague, your boy or girl friend. It doesn?t a matter. Creative gifts will be liked by all. ? Best Quality: We will do our best and will supply you with a high quality ceramic mug printed in the USA. All ceramic cups are dishwasher and microwave safe with with large easy grip handle. The imprinted is printed on both sides of the mug and guaranteed to last. 100% total and complete satisfaction guaranteed! ? Unique and funny: There are only few things that have the power to connect people from all around the world. Coffee is one such thing. This unique Surgeon mug is a great occasion to discuss a lot with just a cup of coffee in our hands. Nothing can make people happier than holding a cup of hot coffee with some uncommon coffee mugs. So gifting the funny coffee mugs is a great idea to make them remember you with every sip they take. ? Stylish: Hold a stylish and awesome coffee mug in your hand, you make a stylish statement in a silent way. Get the unique custom coffee cups with unforgettable title General Surgeon Because Miracle worker isn't an official job title , add to your collection and show how awesome you are. ? Memorable: Unique and Funny coffee mugs are intended for coffee lovers and also for all who enjoy the quality of art. When you buy our personalized coffee mug to someone, either they will preserve it to their collections or they will find a cup of coffee for themselves. Whatever it may be they will remember you every morning. Design:Z246","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vQoTHdBYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderful Mugs","source_asin":"B06Y3Y35PF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y3Y35PF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y3Y35PF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
