window.products.push({"id":489198,"name":"Flexzion Chicken Egg Basket Wire Egg Holder with Wooden Handles for Egg, Fruits, Vegetables Storage, Display Metal Mesh, Basket Holder Countertop for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CT46AFdoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep eggs fresh, organized, ventilated, and at the ready with this chicken wire design. A vintage-inspired wire egg basket with a smooth wire finish. This decorative and useful style of egg basket will keep your eggs safe while collecting and carrying chicken, quail, duck eggs from the coop to the kitchen. It will look great sitting on your countertop holding fresh eggs, fruits, and vegetables.The perfect unique decorative baskets space saver for your beautiful kitchen countertop. Never have your eggs scattered rolling around or in danger of being cracked broken again. Place this tray and basket combination in your kitchen to not only display your eggs with charm but also keep them safe and easy to dispense. Specification: Wire Egg Tray Basket Wire Egg Tray Basket Color: Black Color: Black Material: Powder Coated Iron Material: Powder Coated Iron Egg Holder Basket Dimensions: 8.5 x 8 x 7.5 Inch(22x20x19cm) Egg Holder Basket Dimensions: 8.5 x 8 x 7.5 Inch(22x20x19cm) Package Content: 1 x Wire Egg Storage Basket w/ Vintage Wooden Top Handle for Chicken Egg Carrying Collecting, Display Metal Wire Basket Holder Countertop Organizer for Farmhouse Rustic Kitchen Counter, Black 1 x Wire Egg Storage Basket w/ Vintage Wooden Top Handle for Chicken Egg Carrying Collecting, Display Metal Wire Basket Holder Countertop Organizer for Farmhouse Rustic Kitchen Counter, Black","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CT46AFdoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B09P4M3YKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P4M3YKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P4M3YKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":489199,"name":"Grassl Liberté Wine Glass, Hand-Blown Crystal Universal Wine Glass for all Red and White Wine Types","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X8Q0rVaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REGIONS AND VARIETIES: Ideal for all types of wine, the Liberté is the perfect, multifunctional glass. Each large wine glass is exquisitely designed and specifically shaped in order to pronounce the taste profiles of wines particularly from the Champagne, Beaujolais, Valpolicella, and Burgenland regions. QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP: Each mouth-blown glass is produced through a rigorous artisanal process requiring 5 expert craftsmen. The crystal is reinforced through multiple heating and cooling cycles, coupled with tempering the mouth. The end result is an incredibly lightweight yet resilient thin crystal glass that is free of imperfections. FOR THE CONNOISSEUR: Designed with the help of winemakers, oenologists, professionals, and enthusiasts alike, the Liberté glass will perfectly partner with any wine. The intentional design makes these glasses perfect for swirling and sniffing. Whether you are an aspiring sommelier, you like to have tastings with your colleagues, or you simply enjoy wine as a hobby, Grassl Glasses are a great place to start. EXPERTLY DESIGNED: Our long-stemmed glasses are made with a continuous piece of pulled crystal and are therefore more resistant to breakage. The wide bottom opens the wine up quickly while the tapered, smaller opening at the rim captures the aromas and brings the focus to the nose. Finally, the cold-cut rim seals the glass in a non-porous condition, ensuring smooth delivery from glass to mouth. DIMENSIONS AND DETAILS: The measurements of the Liberté are as follows: mouth opening is 62 mm, bowl is 92 mm, stem width is 5 mm, and rim to stem is 230 mm. You'll receive a single, dishwasher-safe wine glass with your order. Try Grassl's fine glassware for a luxurious experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X8Q0rVaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRASSL GLASS","source_asin":"B08YC8LQ6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YC8LQ6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YC8LQ6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
