window.products.push({"id":489227,"name":"Wablo.T Classic MCM Styling Coffee Cups with Saucers, 6 Ounce, Blue-Gray,Service for 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V96CJM3QL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Coffee Mugs & Saucers, Service for 2 Capacity :250ml each Package: 2* mug 2* Saucer   Round shape with an elegant handle,the mug fits snugly in the recessed center of its coordinating saucer for a drip-free tea/coffee/milk service. Lovely ,artful and handy for every use at home or in your office. Perfect size for pulling doppios directly from coffee machine. A nice gift for friends, families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V96CJM3QL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wablo.T","source_asin":"B07FCKP9V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FCKP9V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FCKP9V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":489228,"name":"Now Designs Scrubby Stripe Dishcloths, Raspberry, Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Imj7NsqXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Refresh those threadbare dishcloths with this bright set of three from Now Designs. With soft terry on one side and scrubby polyester mesh on the other, this set is ready to do double duty in your kitchen. Use the scrubby side for stubborn, baked-on messes: it will get the job done without damaging or scratching your cookware. (Great for glass bakeware and non-stick pans). The soft terry cotton reverse side is a perfect all-purpose dishcloth for gentler cleaning. Each Scrubby Stripe Dishcloth measures 10 by 10-inch, and is machine washable. Set includes one solid and two striped dishcloths. Amazon.com Now Designs Color Center Collection Now Designs has been creating beautiful and functional kitchen textiles and table linens for over 40 years. We design high quality aprons, mitts and dish towels in a wide selection of colors and patterns. At Now Designs we take color seriously! We share a love and passion for color. Our mission is to bring color to your kitchen. The Color Center is the foundation of Now Designs. It features a wide array of aprons, mitts, potholders, kitchen towels, dishcloths and kitchen rugs in twelve bright, beautiful colors. We invite you to mix, match and use your creativity and imagination to color your kitchen to reflect your style. Now Designs has got your kitchen covered. Our heavyweight aprons are built to last, and we've got dish towels for every use imaginable. Whether it's scrubbing, washing, drying or polishing, you'll find the best tool for the job in the Color Center. Aprons At Now Designs we've been making our aprons the same way for over 40 years. We start with strong, heavyweight 100% cotton twill, dyed with high quality color-fast dyes, cut it into the ideal classic apron shape and sew it together with high-strength bar-tacks at seven stress points. Put it all together and you've got an apron built to withstand the rigors and abuses of daily use in the busiest kitchens. The neck strap is adjustable for the perfect fit. One size fits all. Basic Mitts and Potholders Made from the same heavy weight twill as our aprons, our mitts and potholders are designed for comfort and heat protection. Utramitts and Ultragrips The Ultramitt and Ultragrip family features heat, steam, and flame-resistant silicone. Grab the hottest pan or dish with confidence. The Ultramitt & Ultragrip's unique pattern of raised squares keeps moisture off the contact surface. It's the same concept that keeps winter tires from slipping. They are made with silicone that has been bonded to cotton under extremely high pressure. The result is a high-tech material that combines the heat protection of silicone with the flexibility of cotton fabric. The Ultramitt's opposable-thumb design is engineered to provide the best fit for all hands, left and right. They are safe to machine wash and dry. Hang-up Towels This unique and highly absorbent 100% cotton towel comes with metal snap closures for hanging over your oven door handle. It comes out of the dryer in ready to use condition - no folding required! Floursack Dishtowels Often imitated, never duplicated, the Now Designs Floursack towel is simply the best for dying dishes and glasses. Perfect lint-free, streak-free drying every time. Generously sized at 20\"x30\". 100% cotton. Symmetry Dishtowels These soft and thirsty jacquard-woven towels are the quintessential multipurpose cloths. 100% cotton. 18\"x28\". Basketweave Dishtowels and Dishcloths These textured striped towels can do it all. Extra absorbent and durable, basketweave dishcloths make doing the dishes a breeze. 100% cotton. Towels are 16\"x25\". Cloths are 14\"x14\". Scrubby Dishcloths Soft cotton terry one side and scrubby mesh on the other, this dishcloth is on double duty. Great for glass and all cookware surfaces, these cloths are gentle but effective. 100% cotton terry with polyester mesh. 10\"x10\". Jumbo Dishtowels Big jobs need big towels. These extra large 24\"x36\" towels are great for drying pots and pans. Each set of three contains one plaid and two stripes. 100% cotton. Barmops Barmops are known for outstanding absorbency and durability. Perfect for wiping down kitchen counters and surfaces. 100% cotton. 16\"x18\". Ripple Towels Dry your hands in the kitchen with luxurious soft Turkish cotton. These thick and thirsty towels are made of the highest quality 100% cotton. 18\"x28\". Waffle Dishcloths These loosely-woven 100% cotton waffle-weave dishcloths are a terrific bargain and add a dash of color to your dish washing routine. Education without Borders A percentage of the profit on the sales of Now Designs product lines go to Education without Borders. The objective of the foundation is to foster educational opportunities and provide educational facilities in disadvantaged regions of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Imj7NsqXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B00KAFCKX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KAFCKX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KAFCKX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
