window.products.push({"id":489236,"name":"Cherished Teddies BRYCE I Scored A Strike When I Met You Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mFRrOVamL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bryce is a figurine that was released in 2001. He comes in the original box with all the original papers including the Certificate of Adoption. Bryce is 3 3/4” x 3” x 2 3/4” high. Bryce is dressed in a blue jacket and just scored a strike when he slid down the lane on his stomach while holding the ball. When you lift this piece you can hear the ball hitting the pins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mFRrOVamL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cherished Teddies","source_asin":"B00141AYDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00141AYDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00141AYDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
