window.products.push({"id":489311,"name":"Our 25th Christmas As Husband & Wife - 25 Year Wedding Anniversary Christmas Tree Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sChOclJEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A stunning addition to your Christmas tree this festive season is this solid metal and hand sculpted 25 year anniversary Christmas tree hanging decoration. If you have celebrated your 25th wedding anniversary this year then this decoration is just a perfect way to hang this memory from your tree. We see lots of babies 1st Christmas hanging ornaments but now you can have a 25th anniversary hanging Christmas tree ornament.  We have two version, one reads 'Our 25th Christmas as Husband & Wife' perfect if you are celebrating your 25th wedding anniversary.  A second which reads, 'Our 25th Christmas together' Perfect if you are together but not yet married. A perfect Christmas tree ornament for anyone.  Features a rustic hanging heart which hangs from a red ribbon with a cast holly in the left hand corner, the text is hand stamped so no piece is the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sChOclJEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pirantin","source_asin":"B07KG9SSN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KG9SSN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KG9SSN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
