window.products.push({"id":489389,"name":"RESPAWN RSP-400 Big and Tall Racing Style Gaming Chair, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21dFtKYeOyL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you’re looking for a heavy-duty gaming chair that commands attention, the RESPAWN 400, in Green, is the chair for you and your gaming setup. With all the right adjustments to keep you comfortable for the long haul, the RSP-400 is the definitive big and tall gaming chair. The tilt lever is integrated into the side of the seat for convenience and the adjustable tilt tension controls the speed of your recline. The 4D armrests adjust for height, width, depth, and tilt and the adjustable lumbar and headrest pillows give you total control of your support. With 25 years of ergonomic workplace furniture experience, RESPAWN builds gaming furniture that is both durable and comfortable. An award-nominated brand, RESPAWN is committed to your satisfaction and covers this desk with our RESPAWN 5-Year Limited Warranty. This big and tall gaming chair features bonded leather and a 400 lb weight capacity, the RESPAWN 400 is battle-tested and built to perform under the toughest conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21dFtKYeOyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RESPAWN","source_asin":"B07FB7R5M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FB7R5M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FB7R5M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":489390,"name":"MEPTY Space Heater for Large Room, 1500W Fast Heating Ceramic Electric Heater with Thermostat, Oscillation, 1-8H Timer, Overheating & Tip-Over Protect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6Z4i4UNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【Fast & Efficient Heating】If you are looking for a fast heating heater for livingroom/bedroom/office, this powerful ceramic space heater will bring you instant & widespread warmth. MEPTY ceramic space heater comes 1500W PTC heating panel, delivering hot air around the bedroom/living room/office quickly, pushing air farther away evenly. It's more energy-efficient than other electric space heaters, ideal for large room. 🔥【Customized the temperature】Our fireplace space heater features 2 different heat settings (Low, High) as well as a fan-only mode, and Equipped with an adjustable thermostat, just set the dial to the desired heat setting and let the thermostat monitor the surrounding air temperature, balances energy consumption to fit the required heating needs at any moment. 🔥【8H Timer& Super Quiet】The space heater has a timer that can be set in increments of hours from 1-8 hours. Adopted ultra-quiet design, with exclusive way to control the noise when it works, doesn’t bother you whether you’re working or sleeping. Small heaters are useful gifts for mom dad grandparents wife friends on Christmas, Thanksgiving, birthday, New Year and so on. 🔥【Handy and Portable Heater】 Boost your home's heating system by our fireplace heater. Unlike those small space heaters, it offers a wider heating range & dissipation grill, dispersing the air evenly. The compact and portable design combined with the ergonomic built-in handle, will allow you to easily move your space heater to any room you want. 🔥【Multiple Safe and Worry-Free】We have ensured the safety of you and your loved ones by adding an advanced overheat protection sensor as well as a smart tip-over switch, which will automatically turn off the heater in case it overheats or gets tipped over by your kids or pets. Forget the chilly times and enjoy a warm and comfy room! 🔥【Nice home decoration】Burning log design make the effect of true flame of heater, which can embellish your room when enjoying the warming.Consider buying one set for your sweet home. Makes the perfect gift for the coming winter and holidays! 🔥【Quality Service】We only make high-quality space heater, which are of moderate price and you can use it everywhere, such as sitting room and bedroom. Maybe you only spend a little more, but it does bring you a real improvement in the quality of life. Whether it is pre-sale or after-sales, Welcome to consult us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6Z4i4UNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEPTY","source_asin":"B0BHRZHHRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHRZHHRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHRZHHRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
