window.products.push({"id":489435,"name":"Melange Nouveau Classic Premium Porcelain 30-PiecePlace Setting, Ivory, Service for 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iwHY1SFbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Melange is about the essence of meals. It is designed to coordinate with your existing heirloom pottery as well as mix and match with formal and casual stemware and flatware. The premium porcelain material makes it suitable to serve your meals from the microwave; the large mugs are designed to welcome you in the mornings; the sophisticated yet functional design of the fine china place setting lets you shine during sushi for two or other special meals. The chip resistant plates will perform at your fiesta parties every time and wash white and clean in your dishwasher. It is vitrified to withstand everyday basic catering and can also be used as a commercial hotel collection or at the grand buffet of a wedding. Porcelain is harder and more durable than stoneware or earthenware. The water porosity is close to 0 percent while in stoneware it could be as much as 2%. Greater the water porosity greater the possibility of moisture retention in dinnerware and hence lesser the durability. Stoneware is vitrified at approx. 40% lower temperatures compared to Porcelain. Due to this they can scratch more easily. Nouveau Classic dinnerware embodies simple sophistication and tradition. The dishware is inspired by the scenic countryside of a French village. The subtle ripple design is enrobed in pristine white china. The functional and yet timeless form gives the host plenty of opportunities to impress at formal dinner parties or at outdoor lunches on warm sunny afternoons. Each piece combines various aspects of antique French style and mixes and matches well with other conventional dinnerware and modern dining sets. Ready for classic French gastronomy? Nouveau Classic is a great commercial product safe for cutting on with knives and keeping the food surface non-absorbent. Available in 20, 30 and 40-piece place settings. It's a great for a wedding, birthday or Christmas gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iwHY1SFbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B00FYWPYOG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FYWPYOG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FYWPYOG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
