window.products.push({"id":489457,"name":"Belffin Velvet Reversible Sectional Sofa with Chasie Convertible Sectional Couch with Storage Ottoman L Shaped 4-seat Sectional Sofa Couch Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7+ZLKSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXQUISITE & STYLISH DESIGN: This sectional sofa is made of soft, durable and very elegant vintage velvet fabric, the seat cushions with tuft design, and armrests with sandwich design.The sectional sofa is a good choice for your home decroation. MOVABLE STORAGE OTTOMAN: The ottoman of this sectional couch can be moved freely, not only as a chaise of the sofa, but also as a footrest or a coffee table to meet the various living needs of different families.And the ottoman also has storage function, you can place magazines,toy,remote control,pillows etc,saving space for your room. STURDY SOLID WOOD STRUCTURE: The frame of this 4-seat L Shaped sofa is made of high quality solid wood. The solid wood frame can add more support to the sofa, make the sectional sofa more stable and durable. SUPERIOR QUALITY & SOFTY CUSHIONS:The seat cushions of the sectional sofa are made of high resilience foam, have better resilience and softness.Sofa back cushions are 100% filled with premium cotton,which are fluffy and soft.And all cushion covers are removable and washable. Easier to clean the L shaped sectional sofa with chaise. SUITABLE DIMENSIONS: Overall dimensions of L shaped sectional couch is 106.7\"(W) x 62.2\"(D) x 35.8\"(H). Dimensions of single storage ottoman is 23.6\"(W) x 31.5\"(D) x18.5\"(H) . Space saving and durable.Belffin has an excellent after-sale service team, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. We are glad to serve you. PLEASE NOTE：All seat cushions and back cushions are vacuum compressed packaging.After opening the package,it will take some time for the cushion to return to its original shape.Place it in a ventilated place in the sun to accelerate its recovery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X7+ZLKSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belffin","source_asin":"B0BPL9P9CR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPL9P9CR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPL9P9CR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
