window.products.push({"id":489560,"name":"DHNLW Non-Slip Bathtub Stickers, 24 PCS Anti Slip Bath Shower Strips Waterproof Safety Treads Adhesive Decals with Premium Scraper for Bath Tub Shower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y3I18ks6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"� Design Principle: Non-slip bathtub stickers can easily stick to the smooth surface of bathtub using special ecological glue, which adopts stereoscopic texture to increase friction between the user and the smooth area. What's more, it allows water to flow freely further reducing the chances of sewage accumulation. � Advantages: Bathtub stickers is made of high quality PEVA material, which is non-slip, waterproof, eco-friendly, strong viscosity, soft and wear-resistant. DHNLW non-slip strips are more lightweight and convenient than the other brands' bathtub mats. It is also safe to use, easy to remove, easy to maintain and residue free. � Easy To Use: Please use a damp cloth to clean the area where you want to stick the non-slip strips before applied. After dry, peel of the non-slip strips from the protective paper to stick. After pasting, press the anti-slip strip gently and exhaust the air with scraper to make it firmer. And then, using the smooth area after 12 hours to make the non-slip treads more durable on the area. � Application For Most Smooth Area: Bathtub stickers works well for bathroom, bathtub, shower rooms, kitchen, swimming pool, stairs, floors, ladder and more. Ideally, the 24 stickers can occupy most of the surface of bathtub thereby reducing the risk of accidental slips. � Package Contents: 24 PCS non-slip bathtub stickers, 1* high-quality silicone scraper black scraper, 1* user's manual. Individual tread size: 7.9\" long x 0.8\" wide. Scraper size: 5.3\" long x 2.4\" wide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y3I18ks6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHNLW","source_asin":"B09CQDFKXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CQDFKXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CQDFKXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
