window.products.push({"id":489569,"name":"Bring the Light of Tradition and Elegance to Your Home with the 10 Inch Gold Menorah - A Beautiful and Authentic Replica of the Ancient Jewish Temple ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EyGbhllCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Menora 10 Inch Gold is a stunning and elegant addition to any home or collection. The Menorah is beautifully crafted with a traditional 7 light 6 branch design, inspired by the ancient Jewish Temple Menorah. The gold color and antique design add a touch of class and elegance to any room. This Menorah is a replica of King David's Menorah, a symbol of the Jewish people and their connection to their heritage. It is a traditional Hebrew lampstand that brings a touch of Jewish history to any home. The Menorah is also perfect for use during the Jewish holiday of Hanukkah, where a candle is lit each night for 8 days, starting on the first night. The quality of this Menorah is outstanding, it is well-made and sturdy, it looks like it could withstand many years of use. It is very easy to insert the candles, and it holds them securely. This Menorah is also a perfect gift for any Jewish household, or for those who appreciate Jewish art and culture. It is a great value for the price and it is sure to be a cherished piece in any home. Add a touch of gold and history to your home with the Menora 10 Inch Gold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EyGbhllCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Native Spirit","source_asin":"B09QWYLH23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QWYLH23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QWYLH23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
