window.products.push({"id":489893,"name":"Giza-Egyptian-Dreams-Set-My-Sheet-&-Pillow, 100% Giza Egyptian Cotton Sheet Set |Queen Size, Plum Color| 4-PC Sheet Set, Silky Satin Breathable Giza C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zxFX0EXrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DEEP POCKET WITH ALL-AROUND ELASTIC FOR A SNUG FIT: QUEEN Dream Egyptian Giza Cotton Sheet Set includes 1 Fitted sheet: 60 inches x 80 inches, 1 Flat sheet: 90 inches x 102 inches and 2 Pillowcases: 20 inches x 30 inches. Fully elasticized fitted sheet provide 15-inch-deep pockets are generously sized to accommodate both deep and pillow-top mattresses. Flat sheet and pillowcases come with a tailored hem stitch giving them a classy look. YOUR Dream Egyptian Giza SetS EGYPTIAN COTTON 4 PCs SET - When crafting our authentic, Dream Egyptian Giza Premium Cotton Sheet sets, we use only pure, 100% long staple Giza Egyptian Cotton Yarns, which are renowned for their superior quality and durability and must for Giza Sets. A sateen finish offers a lustrous look like silk or satin, yet more breathable and natural. Our fabrics are of the highest quality and used in Hotel Quality sheets as well. LUXURY YOU CAN SEE AND FEEL: Create a welcoming environment and a restful feeling in the bedroom with this TOP QUALITY and AFFORDABLE Bedding Sheets. You’ll find yourself getting a restful night of sleep on our comfortable bed sheets. The 100% Giza Cotton Fabric is Our Perfect Solution to Luxurious and Affordable Bedding. Its Long Staple Cotton Makes it Ultra Soft, Breathable Weave that is Stain Resistant. Its Sateen Weave Gives them Luxurious Finish. SUSTAINABLE & ECO-FRIENDLY : When crafting our authentic, High quality sets, we use only pure, 100% long staple Egyptian cotton yarns, which are renowned for their superior quality and durability. A Sateen Finish Offers a Lustrous Look Like Silk or Satin, Yet More Breathable and Natural. Made of Natural Fibers, these Top-Performance Sheets are the Ultimate Sheets for Night Sweats. Ideal for all Types of Bedroom or Guest Room, New Appartment Bedroom. CARE GUIDE: Machine wash in warm and tumble dry on low, do not bleach. When machine drying, never dry at high temperatures. If your dryer is adjustable, use the medium fan and spin speed. For bed linens it is important to remove from dryer before completely dry, gently fold then iron, if needed. Egyptian Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a few washes to experience the silky softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zxFX0EXrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Femini Fashion","source_asin":"B0BX6V7FW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX6V7FW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX6V7FW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
