window.products.push({"id":489984,"name":"YBM Home Classic 9.5 Inch Nonstick Crepe Pan with Riveted Handle, MultiPurpose Aluminum Dual-Layer Teflon Cookware for Crepes, Omelettes, Pancakes and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DA39v2tVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INDUCTION COMPATIBLE - Works on gas stove tops, glass top, flat top, electric, halogen, ceramic, and induction types. These are freezer safe for food storage. SUPERIOR NON-STICK PERFORMANCE: This Ybmhome Teflon classic nonstick crepe pan is exceptionally durable and scratch resistant, safe for use with metal utensil, Riveted ergonomic silicone handle is strongly a heat safe comfortable non-slip grip that resists rust and dullness This pan is essential for big breakfasts, crepes, tortillas, quesadillas, roasted vegetables, grilled sandwiches, omelets, scrambled eggs, saute's of mushrooms, onions, peppers, etc. ULTRA DURABLE & DISHWASHER SAFE: Dishwasher safe but hand washing recommended. For hand cleaning first use a paper towel, wooden, or plastic spatula to remove off any loose food from the pan; then use a soft nylon scrubber, sponge, or paper towel sprinkled with a few drops of dish-washing soap to wipe the nonstick surface clean. Smooth bottom with no grooves will make it a breeze to wash away after using it. CONVENIENT DESIGN: Durable aluminum construction for fast and even heat distribution and the interior features a long-lasting, nonstick finish, Lightweight aluminum body and elegantly crafted oven-safe stay cool long riveted handle built for convenience and style. The light aluminum body promotes easy cooking in the kitchen. YBMHOM LARGE TEFLON CLASSIC NONSTICK CREPE PAN MEASURES : 9.5 inches Diameter x .5 in. depth. Riveted Handle length is 6 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DA39v2tVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YBM HOME","source_asin":"B074ZPVJ1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-489984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074ZPVJ1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074ZPVJ1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
